      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. i actually did things that were unforgivable. i saw the look in their eyes when they realized what i'd done and i know i can never fix it. no amount of \"help\" or \"talking\" changes the fact that i'm fundamentally a broken, bad person. how can anyone say i deserve to be here when i've already ruined everything?",
